[{"anchor":"press","action":"用手向下压","cn":"压","members":[{"word":"compress","clue":"com- 一起","meaning":"压缩"},{"word":"depress","clue":"de- 向下","meaning":"使沮丧；按下"},{"word":"express","clue":"ex- 向外","meaning":"表达；快递"},{"word":"impress","clue":"im- 向内","meaning":"留下印象"},{"word":"oppress","clue":"op- 反着","meaning":"压迫"},{"word":"suppress","clue":"sup- 从下","meaning":"抑制；镇压"}],"sentence":"他压抑(depress)情绪，却表达(express)了深刻印象(impress)。"},{"anchor":"vis / vid","action":"用眼睛看","cn":"看","members":[{"word":"visit","clue":"走去看","meaning":"参观；拜访"},{"word":"vision","clue":"名词","meaning":"视力；视野"},{"word":"visible","clue":"能看见的","meaning":"可见的"},{"word":"revise","clue":"re- 再看","meaning":"复习；修订"},{"word":"supervise","clue":"super- 从上往下","meaning":"监督"},{"word":"evidence","clue":"e- 明显可见","meaning":"证据"}],"sentence":"监督(supervise)时多用眼睛，证据(evidence)也靠看(vis)得来。"},{"anchor":"spect","action":"朝某个方向看","cn":"look 看","members":[{"word":"expect","clue":"ex- 向外看","meaning":"期待；预料"},{"word":"inspect","clue":"in- 向内看","meaning":"检查"},{"word":"respect","clue":"re- 再看","meaning":"尊重"},{"word":"aspect","clue":"a- 朝…看","meaning":"方面"},{"word":"prospect","clue":"pro- 向前看","meaning":"前景；希望"}],"sentence":"我们尊重(respect)每个方面(aspect)，也期待(expect)好前景(prospect)。"},{"anchor":"tract","action":"用手拉","cn":"拉 pull","members":[{"word":"attract","clue":"at- 朝…拉","meaning":"吸引"},{"word":"contract","clue":"con- 一起拉","meaning":"收缩；合同"},{"word":"distract","clue":"dis- 分开拉","meaning":"使分心"},{"word":"extract","clue":"ex- 向外拉","meaning":"提取；摘录"},{"word":"subtract","clue":"sub- 向下拉","meaning":"减去"}],"sentence":"好广告吸引(attract)你，别被分心(distract)而签了合同(contract)。"},{"anchor":"port","action":"把东西运来运去","cn":"运 carry","members":[{"word":"export","clue":"ex- 向外运","meaning":"出口"},{"word":"import","clue":"im- 向内运","meaning":"进口"},{"word":"transport","clue":"trans- 横穿运","meaning":"运输"},{"word":"report","clue":"re- 往回拿","meaning":"报告"},{"word":"support","clue":"sub- 从下托","meaning":"支持"},{"word":"passport","clue":"pass + port","meaning":"护照